  "title": "November 2024 Updates, Highlighting Key Clinical and Business Developments",
  "summary": "We are pleased to report several significant milestones that reinforce our mission of working together to provide unique products that improve the quality of patient care. Our latest updates include important research findings, growing Medicaid coverage and expanded product access. In October, we announced new real-world outcomes research comparing Caldolor® to its key competitor – […]",
